 term basis, or (b) the enterprise has entered into a financing agreement that clearly permits the enterprise to refinance the short-term obligation on a long term basis and the following conditions are met (1) the agreement does not expire within 1 year and is not cancelable by the lender except for violation of an objectively determinable provision, (2) no violation exists at the BS date, and (3) the lender has entered into the financing agreement is expected to be financially capable of honoring the agreement.","units":{"USD":[{"end":"2011-06-30","val":1436233,"accn":"0001144204-11-069192","fy":2012,"fp":"Q1","form":"10-Q/A","filed":"2011-12-09"},{"end":"2011-06-30","val":1436233,"accn":"0001144204-12-008465","fy":2012,"fp":"Q2","form":"10-Q","filed":"2012-02-14"},{"end":"2011-06-30","val":1436233,"accn":"0001144204-12-029094","fy":2012,"fp":"Q3","form":"10-Q","filed":"2012-05-15"},{"end":"2011-06-30","val":1436233,"accn":"0001144204-12-055322","fy":2012,"fp":"FY","form":"10-K/A","filed":"2012-10-09","frame":"CY2011Q2I"},{"end":"2011-09-30","val":1082008,"accn":"0001144204-11-069192","fy":2012,"fp":"Q1","form":"10-Q/A","filed":"2011-12-09","frame":"CY2011Q3I"},{"end":"2011-12-31","val":774464,"accn":"0001144204-12-008465","fy":2012,"fp":"Q2","form":"10-Q","filed":"2012-02-14","frame":"CY2011Q4I"},{"end":"2012-03-31","val":1350000,"accn":"0001144204-12-029094","fy":2012,"fp":"Q3","form":"10-Q","filed":"2012-05-15","frame":"CY2012Q1I"},{"end":"2012-06-30","val":1000000,"accn":"0001144204-12-055322","fy":2012,"fp":"FY","form":"10-K/A","filed":"2012-10-09"},{"end":"2012-06-30","val":1000000,"accn":"0001144204-12-061184","fy":2013,"fp":"Q1","form":"10-Q","filed":"2012-11-13"},{"end":"2012-06-30","val":1000000,"accn":"0001144204-13-008530","fy":2013,"fp":"Q2","form":"10-Q","filed":"2013-02-14"},{"end":"2012-06-30","val":1000000,"accn":"0001144204-13-029014","fy":2013,"fp":"Q3","form":"10-Q","filed":"2013-05-15"},{"end":"2012-06-30","val":1000000,"accn":"0001144204-13-0